{
  "name": "RE Marketing Automation Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Marketing Automation Agent\n\n**TENEX Equivalent:** Architect Agent designing system structure and patterns\n\n**Core Function:** Maintains consistent market presence without manual effort. Schedules content, promotes listings, and ensures the agent's brand stays visible during busy transaction periods.\n\n## Trigger Events\n- New listing\n- Price change\n- Under contract\n- Just sold\n- Market update release\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Listing views\n- Social engagement\n- Email open rates\n- Brand consistency score",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -200],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Agent Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credentials to Configure\n\n1. `OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID` → AI for content generation\n2. `GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Email distribution\n3. `GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Listing/content tracking\n4. `OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID` → DALL-E for images\n5. `BUFFER_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Social media scheduling (optional)\n6. `CANVA_CREDENTIAL_ID` → Design automation (optional)\n\n## Social Platforms\n- Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn\n- Configure per-platform posting",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, 200],
      "id": "sticky-credentials",
      "name": "Credentials Setup"
    },
